#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `BitArray` objects for performant post-processing {#use-bitarray-objects-for-performant-post-processing}"
msgstr "Utiliser les objets `BitArray` pour un post-traitement performant {#use-bitarray-objects-for-performant-post-processing}"

